+## Readiness source correction (isolated copy, not deployed)
+
+This candidate grants memory:recall only; old broader persisted grants fail
+introspection/refresh/code redemption. The issuer receives only
+PERSONAL_OAUTH_INTROSPECTION_VERIFIER (SHA256 of the complete expected Basic
+header), not a raw introspection secret. Derive the verifier using
+introspectionVerifier(client, randomBase64urlSecret) in the same in-memory
+provisioning step that encrypts the raw secret in the Philote vault. Generate
+32 random bytes (43 base64url characters) or stronger. No raw env/file/log output.
+Gateway retrieves the fixed introspection reference from the scoped hotel
+listener per call. The verifier is authentication configuration, not a gateway
+bearer key; it cannot be used as the Basic secret. Rotate verifier and encrypted
+vault value together through a separately approved operation.
+
+Only percival_connection_test synthetic data is admitted. Earlier private-vault
+examples in this document are not approval to connect private data.
